{"id":952948,"title":"GT CRAFT [IV/MTS]","summary":"Content pack to add 90's sports cars.","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Overview-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHave you ever wanted to drive, drift, or customize a wide range of cars in Minecraft? GT CRAFT is the ideal content pack that author VellEagle sought to form. 43 car models. Numerous aero parts. Many customization features. Then, on August 12, 2025, GTCRAFT updated from 1.1 to 2.0, marking the start of a new evolution.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LzQLbGsy/9.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-How to Install-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e**1. First, install the version of Forge that you want to use, either 1.12.2/1.16.5/1.18.2/1.19.2/1.20.1/1.21.1/26.1\u003cbr\u003e**\u003cstrong\u003e2. After installing Forge, once you have started Minecraft in Forge, make sure that the Mods folder is generated in the .Minecraft folder.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Download the required mod, Immersive Vehicles, and place it in the Mods folder. Choose the version to download that corresponds to the version you are playing.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e**4. Download the GT CRAFT corresponding to the version you wish to use from this site and place it in your Mods folder.\u003cbr\u003e**\u003cstrong\u003e5. If you start Minecraft and the item is reflected, you have succeeded.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Map used-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJDM Minecraft Server\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5hb3rBKz/7.jpg\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-List of Included Cars-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(Commission) Anyone who has Commission a car from the author, VellEagle, for a fee.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal: 43 Models / 57 Variants\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota / Lexus\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota 86 (ZN6)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota Chaser (X100)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota Mark II (X100) [Early / Late] (Commission by DeexelMC/surai0705)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota Supra (A70)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota Supra (A80)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota AE86 Corolla Levin\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota AE86 Sprinter Trueno [Early / Late]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eToyota MR2 (SW20)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLexus LFA [Standard / N\u0026uuml;rburgring Package]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan 180SX\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Silvia S13\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Silvia S14 [Standard / NISMO 270R]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Silvia S15\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Skyline R31\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Skyline GT-R BCNR33 [Standard / NISMO 400R]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Skyline GT-R BNR32\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Skyline GT-R BNR34\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan GT-R R35 [MY17 / MY17 NISMO]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Cedric / Gloria / Cima (Y33)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNissan Fairlady Z (Z32)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHonda\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHonda Civic Type R (EK9)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHonda Integra Type R (DC2)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHonda NSX (NA1) [Standard / Fortune Bodykit]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMazda\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMazda CX-8\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMazda RX-7 (FC3S)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMazda RX-7 (FD3S) [Late Model / Fortune Bodykit]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMitsubishi\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMitsubishi Lancer Evolution III\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMitsubishi Lancer Evolution V\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMitsubishi Lancer Evolution VI [Standard / Tommi M\u0026auml;kinen Edition]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMitsubishi Mirage Asti\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMitsubishi GTO (Z15AM)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubaru\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubaru Impreza WRX STI (GC8 Ver.6)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubaru Impreza WRX STI (GVB) \u0026nbsp;(Commission by DeexelMC)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🌎 Import / Supercars\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChevrolet: Corvette C5\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDodge: Viper ACR\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFord: Mustang GT (2012)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFerrari: FXX K / FXX K Evo\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHyundai: Tiburon / Tuscani V6 (Commission by Kakuzu)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJaguar: XJ220 / XJ220S\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKoenigsegg: Jesko\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLamborghini: Diablo GTR\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMcLaren: F1 LM\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMercedes-Benz: CLK GTR\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePorsche: 911 Carrera RS (964)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSaleen: S7 / S7 LM\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eList of vehicles deleted with the GTC-II update.\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"spoiler\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHonda NSX NA2\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eToyota Celica ST205\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Basically, these cars will be re-added back in future updates, but cars added through commissions will be added back first.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Credits-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNax\u003c/strong\u003e (The new suspension system added in the GT CRAFT 2.1 update was inspired by the system from Kaminari Motor Works. We would like to thank Nax for granting us permission to use it as a reference.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFanisher\u003c/strong\u003e (He was responsible for creating some of the new sounds and parts added in GT CRAFT 2.1.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiren Sounds - \u003ca href=\"https://otologic.jp/free/se/transportation02.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eOtoLogic\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003euntil GT CRAFT 1.1.3\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis content pack is adapted from a portion of the json created by the following people.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ecowboycosmic\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSphase\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOskiinus\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMR.NOTHING\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeexelMC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWe would like to express our sincere thanks to the json authors. I would also like to sincerely thank Don_bruce for creating a wonderful mod called Immersive vehicles.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUse and introduction on Youtube, etc.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBasically, you don't need to get permission from me. However, if possible, please include a link to the download site in the summary. If this is not possible, it would be appreciated if you could indicate the mod name \"GT CRAFT\" in the title or summary.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMy Discord server is here! (Please report any bugs here.)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/uSfmTzV5Ef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://discord.gg/uSfmTzV5Ef\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#e03e2d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAny unauthorized use or reuse of any models or textures included in this mod is strictly prohibited. Please be advised that if we discover content reusing these assets on CF or any other site, we will immediately report it as copyright infringement without exception.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","game":"minecraft","type":"Mods","urls":{"curseforge":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gt-craft-iv-mts","project":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gt-craft-iv-mts"},"thumbnail":"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1397/47/256/256/638905531500833437.png","created_at":"2023-12-24T12:00:13.323Z","downloads":{"monthly":0,"total":191586},"license":"","donate":"","categories":["Player Transport"],"members":[{"title":"Owner","username":"VellEagle","id":102366452}],"links":[],"files":[{"id":9194450,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gt-craft-iv-mts/files/9194450","display":"GT CRAFT - 2.1.2","name":"gtcraft-2.1.2.jar","type":"release","version":"1.16.5","filesize":52530810,"versions":["Client","1.16.5","1.20.1","Forge","1.21.